Evaluation datasets
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

No dataset content is redistributed with this repository. scripts/fetch_fixtures.py
downloads trimmed samples from these public datasets at run time:

  banking77        DeepPavlov/banking77         see dataset card for terms
  clinc150         DeepPavlov/clinc150         original: Larson et al., EMNLP-IJCNLP 2019
  hate_speech      tdavidson/hate_speech_offensive   Davidson et al. 2017
  enron_spam       SetFit/enron_spam            Enron corpus, publicly released
  yelp             bespokelabs/yelp_restaurant_reviews_5k   Yelp

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Methodology reference
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The evaluation protocol (exact-set match, bootstrap confidence intervals,
paired bootstrap, exact McNemar, the disjoint-schema transfer test) follows:

  Rodrigues, C. & Vas, O., "When Do LLMs Replace Fine-Tuned NLU? A Decision
  Framework for Intent Detection in Production Conversational Systems"
  arXiv:2608.20371

